From eea53ae96603dc44ade2ae5bb0433dbe0b00dc59 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Linga Prabu S <lingaprabu.s@spantechnologyservices.com>
Date: Thu, 10 Jul 2025 23:17:25 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] feat: add dynamic schema support for Postgres RecordManager
 and VectorStore

- Add schema input field to PostgresRecordManager with fallback to 'public'
- Add schema support to Postgres VectorStore components
- Update TypeORMDriver to handle schema-qualified table names
- Implement proper SQL escaping for security
- Maintain backward compatibility with existing configurations
---
